# _x6_restart: the mars_city2 start room through vid_restart, reloadShaders and a 1600x900 window and back; frames only at 1280x720.
# reloadShaders relinks every program the process has loaded; this pack has all map-only stages (colorProcess, heatHaze), so any earlier demo is fine.
map game/mars_city2
at 0 god
at 0 notarget
at 1 remove monster_zsec_pistol_2
at 1 setviewpos -300 -2040 84 90
move 10 500 yaw=15
capture 0 100 every=10 fps=60
at 110 vid_restart
capture 111 113
capture 120 200 every=10 fps=60
at 210 reloadShaders
capture 211 213
capture 220 300 every=10 fps=60
# vid_restart applies the window size; the frames in between are 1600x900
at 310 r_windowWidth 1600
at 310 r_windowHeight 900
at 310 vid_restart
at 400 r_windowWidth 1280
at 400 r_windowHeight 720
at 400 vid_restart
capture 401 403
capture 410 500 every=10 fps=60
end 500
